uts.\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"NFR-3\",\n    \"metric\": \"Pass the main-flow UI test suite on 2 latest versions of each of 4 named browsers.\",\n    \"text\": \"The responsive portals support the latest two versions of Chrome, Edge, Safari, and Firefox.\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"NFR-4\",\n    \"metric\": \"Support 1,000 users, 100,000 records in the first year, and data from 5,000 devices reporting at once.\",\n    \"text\": \"The web portal supports the stated first-year user and record volume and displays data from the stated simultaneous device volume.\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"outOfScope\": [],\n  \"requirements\": [\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A user opens each available workflow at a 320 CSS-pixel phone width, a 768 CSS-pixel tablet width, and a 1280 CSS-pixel desktop width\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-1.1\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"the screen content has no horizontal overflow and all interactive controls have a touch target of at least 44 by 44 CSS pixels at the phone width\",\n      \"when\": \"the page is rendered\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"The Meridian web application shall present warehouse, dispatch, quality, administration, auditor, customer, and driver workflows as responsive web pages for phone, tablet, and desktop widths.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-1\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-2\",\n     \"I-3\",\n     \"I-4\",\n     \"I-15\",\n     \"ASM-13\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A staff user opens the sign-in page\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-2.1\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"the screen shows the Meridian Microsoft sign-in option and does not offer staff sign-in through a non-Meridian account form\",\n      \"when\": \"the page is displayed\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A customer user opens the sign-in page\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-2.2\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"the screen shows the co