ies, histories, and budget values\",\n      \"when\": \"a user opens the lot's handling-unit view\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"The Meridian responsive web app shall show stock as separately traceable handling units when portions acquire different temperature histories.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-13\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-6\",\n     \"I-8\",\n     \"I-9\",\n     \"I-13\",\n     \"I-14\",\n     \"Q-5\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A product, lot, and warehouse have stock returned in multiple statuses\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-14.1\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"the screen shows the on-hand total and separate fields for available, allocated, quarantined, On Hold, Rejected, Recalled, and Expired quantities, whose sum equals the on-hand field\",\n      \"when\": \"a user opens the quantity view\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"The Meridian responsive web app shall show on-hand stock and a mutually exclusive quantity breakdown for available, allocated, quarantined, On Hold, Rejected, Recalled, and Expired stock.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-14\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-6\",\n     \"I-9\",\n     \"I-11\",\n     \"I-17\",\n     \"Q-7\",\n     \"ASM-3\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A Warehouse Operator moves stock between shelves or cold rooms\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-15.1\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"the screen shows the returned from and to locations, actor, time, and quantity fields\",\n      \"when\": \"the movement is accepted and its record is opened\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"The Meridian responsive web app shall provide a stock-movement form and show the returned movement record with who moved the stock, when, and from and to locations.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-15\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-9\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A Customer Administrator opens organisation settings\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-16.1\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"the screen shows controls to add, change, or remove saved addresses for that organisation\",\n      \"when\": \"the address page renders\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A customer user or Dispatcher opens an order form\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-16.2\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"the screen shows the organisation's minimum remaining shelf-life value without a control to change it per order\",\n      \"when\": \"the form renders\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A System Administrator opens customer-organisation settings\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-16.3\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"the request contains the organisation-level value and the response status is shown\",\n      \"when\": \"the administrator changes the minimum remaining shelf life\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"The Meridian responsive web app shall let Customer Administrators maintain saved delivery addresses for their organisation and show the organisation's minimum remaining shelf-life value as read-only to customer users.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-16\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-3\",\n     \"I-10\",\n     \"Q-6\",\n     \"ASM-5\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A customer user creates an order\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-17.1\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"the screen shows product-line, quantity, saved-address, delivery-date, and partial-or-complete delivery fields\",\n      \"when\": \"the order form renders\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A customer enters a quantity below one pack or submits an order without a line\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-17.2\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"the screen shows a field error and the request is not sent\",\n      \"when\": \"the customer submits the form\"\n     },\n     {